      "installMethod": "pip",
      "pipPackage": "aqtinstall",
      "note": "Installed via pip (not a standalone hash-pinned .exe), matching the proven manual reference workflow. aqtinstall 3.3.0 cannot install Qt 6.11.x on Windows (pre-6.11 repo folder layout assumption), but Qt is pinned to 6.9.3 below, which still uses the pre-6.11 layout, so no patch is required."
